'''Krookodile''' (Japanese: '''ワルビアル''' ''Waruvial'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

