==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's rare print illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Krookodile|113}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion, and the {{TCGP|Promo-B}} print illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Krookodile|71}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*'''Chomp Chomp Bite''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Krookodile|117}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

